cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "trading-research-agents"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python package and command line (tra) for autonomous crypto trading agents.
  Language models read the market and propose a trade; fixed, tested rules compute every figure,
  price the round trip, size the position and decide whether an order goes out.
authors:
  - name: "Bijective Labs"
    website: "https://bijectivelabs.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BijectiveLabs/trading-research-agents"
url: "https://docs.bijectivelabs.dev/opensource/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - algorithmic trading
  - cryptocurrency
  - trading agents
  - large language models
  - risk management
  - backtesting
  - ccxt
